ved across the street from me in Can Tho in 1993/94 who was a teacher and an officer in the ARVN before &amp;#39;75. He taught my wife and her sister English for an hour each day. I would give him my Southern Partisan each time I received one, and he was very happy to get the one that had Waco in it, as he said that he hadn&amp;#39;t quite believed the Communist propaganda about it (Same as our government) and was happy to read the true account. A gentleman and a scholar.&lt;br /&gt;http://www.namsouth.com/viewtopic.php?t=1813&amp;amp;highlight=thost below:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4473961235659693708/comments/default/95451567689423782'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4473961235659693708/comments/default/95451567689423782'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/lon-horiuchi-american-sniper.html?showComment=1451434999206#c95451567689423782' title=''/><author><name>Brock Townsend</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/11404173139501539265</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='24' src='http://4.bp.blogspot.com/_YJQ6fD7smOY/S2Hj1F08b1I/AAAAAAAAALc/Sbw7hnZvDR8/S220/Core+Creek+Militia.JPG'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/lon-horiuchi-american-sniper.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4473961235659693708' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4473961235659693708' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1383762707"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 29, 2015 at 5:23 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5953197773873112332</id><published>2015-12-29T14:05:26.415-07:00</