ent five minutes (max) on research would have known that the dude was a Combat Engineer for a short spell in the Army, and the &amp;quot;Green Beret&amp;quot; thing was used as an example of rumors spread between inept federal agents.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4473961235659693708/comments/default/4071649147849791575'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4473961235659693708/comments/default/4071649147849791575'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/lon-horiuchi-american-sniper.html?showComment=1444577996282#c4071649147849791575' title=''/><author><name>MrCatch22</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/lon-horiuchi-american-sniper.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4473961235659693708' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4473961235659693708' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-886671827"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 11, 2015 at 9:39 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-335730055981867050</id><published>2015-08-27T20:06:40.103-06:00</published><updated>2015-08-27T20:06:40.103-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I lived in Redmond, WA (just outside Seattle) at t...</title><content type='html'>I lived in Redmond, WA (just outside Seattle) at the time of the Ruby Ridge stand-off and clearly remember one of the mainstream Seattle news radio stations, KVI, report that Vicky was being specifically targeted because she was considered the &amp;quot;Matriarchal Leader&amp;quot; and primary motivator of the stand-off